   "persona": "Dana Pruitt blends data‑driven operational savvy with a love for soulful cooking, spontaneous travel, and community‑focused jazz nights, all while they wrestle with a penchant for last‑minute planning and a deep commitment to mentoring emerging talent.",
   "professional_persona": "Dana Pruitt, an operations specialist with a talent for mapping workflows and turning data insights into actionable process improvements, leverages their SAP and NetSuite expertise to streamline cross‑functional projects while juggling a spontaneous work style that sometimes clashes with tight deadlines, and they are currently pursuing a Lean Six Sigma Black Belt and a part‑time MBA to prepare for an operations leadership role.",
